seq         monotonic, broker-assigned
prev_hash   sha256 of prior event
session     session id
agent       agent id + pubkey fingerprint
type        CLAIM | LEASE | RENEW | SAY | ASK | ANSWER | COMMIT | GATE | REVIEW | MERGE | VETO | REAP
payload     type-specific
ts          broker clock
sig         ed25519 over (seq|prev_hash|payload)
